IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-ROUTER-V5.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-TENANTS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HIGH-PRIORITY       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 DISPATCH-NS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ROUTER-V5.
    IF NUM-TENANTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 26 TO DISPATCH-NS.
    MOVE 24600 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-TENANTS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
